 418            /       NOW BEGINS THE GREAT UPDATE PROCEEDURE, FIRST FOR SHIP
 419            /       NUMBER ONE (THE DELTA SHAPED SHIP WHICH APPEARS ON
 420            /       THE LEFT AT THE START OF THE GAME).  IF ALIVE THE STATUS
 421            /       WORD (INTWRD) IS TESTED FOR REQUESTS FOR LEFT TURN,
 422            /       RIGHT TURN, THRUST ON, AND LAUNCH PROJECTILE.  THESE ACTIONS
 423            /       MAY OR MAY NOT BE ACTED UPON DEPENDING ON COUNTS AND FLAGS.
 424            /       WHEN THIS IS COMPLETE THE SAME OPERATION IS PERFORMED FOR
 425            /       NUMBER TWO.
