1675            /
1676            /       VEELIM IS THE SCALING ROUTINE FOR VELOCITY COMPONENTS.
1677            /       THE COMPONENTS ARE SCALED TO REMAIN IN THE RANGE 140
1678            /       TO -140.  THIS IS NECESSARY TO AVOID ASTRONOMICAL SPPED
1679            /       BUILDUP ON THE SMALL SCREEN.  UNFORTUNATELY THE X AND Y
1680            /       COMPONENTS ARE SCALED SEPARATELY WHICH GIVES SLIGHT BUT
1681            /       NOTICABLE DISTORTIONS IN DIAGONAL FLIGHT PATHS.  IN THE
1682            /       NORMAL HEAT OF THE BATTLE NO ONE WILL REALLY NOTICE.
1683            /
