1726            /       DISPLAY CYCLE IS COMPLETED.  THE ROUTINE WILL THEN DISPLAY
1727            /       THE APPROPRIATE MESSAGE OVER THE REMAINING SHIPS IF
1728            /       ANY UNTIL THE KEYBOARD IS MOLESTED OR THE CLOCK RUNS OUT
1729            /       AND THE NEXT DISPLAY UPDATE CYCLE IS SET.   AT ANY RATE THE
1730            /       PROGRAM WILL REACH HERE ONLY WHEN SOMEONE HAS BITTEN THE
1731            /       INTERGALACTIC DUST.
