1774            /
1775            /       THE FOLLOWING ARE THE SINE AND COSINE ROUTINES CUSTOMIZED
1776            /       FOR THIS PROGRAM FROM ANOTHER I WORKED ON.  CALL EITHER
1777            /       SINE OR COSINE WITH ANGLE IN DEGREES IN AC.  THE ARGUEMENT
1778            /       IS REDUCED THROUGH RECURSION UNTIL BETWEEN 0-89 DEGREES 
1779            /       AND THEN A TABLE LOOKUP DONE TO OBTAIN THE VALUE.  IT TAKES
1780            /       UP A FAIR AMOUNT OF SPACE BUT IT WORKS JUST FASTER
1781            /       THAN SHEEP.  THE COSINE CALL JUST TRANSFORMS THE ARGUEMENT 
1782            /       THROUGH SOME TRIGONOMETRIC GARBAGE AND CALLS THE SINE
1783            /       ROUTINE.  NOTE THAT CALLING EITHER ROUTINE WITH TOO 
1784            /       LARGE AN ARGUEMENT WILL CAUSE PUSHDOWN OVERFLOW AND THEN
1785            /       ALL HELL WILL BREAK LOOSE.  THE ORIGINAL ROUTINE FROM WHICH
1786            /       THIS WAS STOLEN HAD FULL WORD PRECISION.
1787            /
