2016            /
2017            /       POSCAL IS CALLED TO CALCULATE THE COORDINATE INCREMENTS
2018            /       NECESSARY TO PRODUCE THE SHIP FIGURES.  RATHER THAN DOING
2019            /       A LOT OF EXPENSIVE MATH THIS DOES A QUICK PRODUCTION
