2079 07031 3334         DCA CURPLT      /SAVE CURRENT PLOT BITS
2080 07032 1340 XPLOT,  TAD KM6 /INITIALIZE 6-BIT
2081 07033 3336         DCA COUNT6      /       COUNTER
2082 07034 1330         TAD YVALUE      /RESET Y TEMPORARY
